{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2015-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1427846400, "end_date": 1428451199, "month_true_total": 434, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:09:50 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "15257565", "author": {"steamid": "76561198085458418", "personaname": "★Rayniku", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/spookiskeletons/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1538, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 654, "last_played": 1772594140, "avatar": "1fa48f3adeb9594213eb5579244b70f7430ff46e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm having a difficult time trying to find any negatives about this amazing, Rogue-Like arcade style game. \n\nANYWAYS\n\nRisk of Rain is a breathe of fresh air amongst the Rogue-Like games out. It's art style is absolutely crazy good, I've never seen any other pixelated game manipulate particles like I've seen in this. The statistics that exist in this add that this isn't just your every-day arcade game, it's in-game difficulty, characters, secrets, enemies and weapons/items just make it inevitibly impossible to NOT play.\n\n====================================\nTo summarize, The positives;\n\n\n+Amazing pixel graphics & art style\n\n+Intriguing control & attack system\n\n+Unlockable characters & items/weapons\n\n+Annoying enemies fun to kill\n\n+Full of exploration and secrets, unique difficulty clock & levels with a money system involved\n\n+Rogue-Like game, addictive in the end\n\n+It's always different, every playthrough you make\n====================================\nAnd the negatives;\n\n-Very difficult at first, which usually turns people off unless they're unwilling to be challenged.\n\n-Some parts of the game seem very difficult, unless you try your hardest.\n\n-It takes a LOT of time to get through levels/areas, which is sometimes not really a negative.\n\n-It gets crazy near the end & it'll take a lot to survive, which actually may not be a negative.\n====================================\n\nOverall, do yourself a favour and buy this game. I promise you will not regret the decision. Absolutely everything is perfectly made in this, making it a must-buy.", "timestamp_created": 1428450505, "timestamp_updated": 1428450505, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15257225", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046807777", "personaname": "Lut", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198046807777/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 8685, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1316, "last_played": 1734938339, "avatar": "af03d4c37008affc0cc3bb682a787120dac37518"}, "language": "english", "review": "The restaurant is open for business, GLAZE IT N' BLAZE IT BABY", "timestamp_created": 1428448489, "timestamp_updated": 1428448489, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502487540245056152", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15256378", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983846672", "personaname": "KinkyFreddieMercury", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KinkyFreddie/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1965, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 596, "last_played": 1531272975, "avatar": "ccbbd958978e204e46b2e0aa9e9103744809edc1"}, "language": "english", "review": "binding of is